                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Clear custom assignments in the titlebar is always available in Custom controls. In the dialog, Clear both banks is dimmed when nothing is assigned and Use default assignments is dimmed when the map already is the default."
